  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.1, the first release, for .NET 8, 9 and 10. SvirfdClient with Auto, Remote, Local and Directory modes: the whole index in your process with live deltas, or the API, or a folder of files for a machine with no internet. The full record for any IPv4 or IPv6 address (registry, routing with RPKI, ASN, network type, VPN, Tor and relay lists, cloud region, location with its source and confidence, ping density), record.Narrate() for a plain-English explanation, and an XML documentation file for IntelliSense. One SvirfdClient per process: register it as a singleton (see Svirfd.Extensions.Hosting) or construct it once. https://svirfd.com/dotnet-ip-geolocation",
